  "tagline": "Enterprise RAG and agent platform with managed hybrid retrieval, reranking and hallucination scoring.",
  "description": "Vectara is a managed retrieval-augmented generation platform: you upload documents and it handles chunking, embedding (its Boomerang model), hybrid semantic plus lexical indexing, multilingual reranking, generation and factual-consistency scoring with its Hughes Hallucination Evaluation Model. It has repositioned as an enterprise agent platform with governed, auditable agents built on that retrieval stack, deployable as SaaS, in your VPC or on-prem. It is an option for enterprises that want RAG as a product rather than assembling a vector database, embedder and LLM themselves, with pricing to match.",
